Free the nodes of a seam map list when destroying it

lqr_vmap_list_destroy () destroyed the seam maps of the list but not the
list nodes, 16 bytes per map dumped with lqr_carver_set_dump_vmaps ()
(LeakSanitizer).

--- a/lqr/lqr_vmap_list.c
+++ b/lqr/lqr_vmap_list.c
@@ -61,6 +61,7 @@ lqr_vmap_list_destroy(LqrVMapList *list)
     if (now != NULL) {
         lqr_vmap_list_destroy(now->next);
         lqr_vmap_destroy(now->current);
+        g_free(now);
     }
 }
 
